# Morrowind Daedric quests: Malacath's false hero (DA_Malacath). Malacath's statue in Assurdirapal sets the quest
# (10) and enables Farvyn Oreyn's party near Gnaar Mok. In Vivec the player hears of Oreyn Bearclaw (20) and of
# Farvyn Oreyn (30); in Gnaar Mok that Farvyn arrived a day ago (40). Farvyn owns up to the lie ("Kharag gro-Khar":
# 50) and, told the player comes from Malacath (1), sets his guards on them; his death logs 60 (farvynScript), and the
# statue gives the Helm of Oreyn Bearclaw (70).
# PositionCell and Position stand in for the travel, the console kill for the fight. FormIDs carry Morrowind.esm's
# slot 05: 05565296 Malacath's statue, 05477FCA Farvyn Oreyn.
# Run: python -m tools.live.test_instance mwtest --cases <this folder> --fast --checkpoints --stop-on-fail --load mwtest_da_mehrunes_done --timeout 3600
# See docs/commentary/headless_testing.md#quest-runs

case da_malacath_start
run
player->PositionCell 4344 4150 13893 0 "Assurdirapal, Inner Shrine"
wait 120
activate 05565296
until 300 GetJournalIndex DA_Malacath == 10
end

case da_malacath_rumors
run
player->PositionCell -1031 -150 -616 0 "Vivec, High Fane"
until 600 "endryn llethan"->GetDistance player < 600
wait 60
talk endryn llethan
ask Oreyn Bearclaw
expect GetJournalIndex DA_Malacath == 20
ask Farvyn Oreyn
expect GetJournalIndex DA_Malacath == 30
bye
run
player->Position -60692 26800 303 0
approach 053E05E5
until 600 "nadene rotheran"->GetDistance player < 1000
wait 60
talk nadene rotheran
ask Farvyn Oreyn
expect GetJournalIndex DA_Malacath == 40
bye
end

case da_malacath_farvyn
run
player->Position -65116 21500 117 0
until 600 "farvyn oreyn"->GetDistance player < 1000
wait 60
talk farvyn oreyn
ask Kharag gro-Khar
expect GetJournalIndex DA_Malacath == 50
choose 1
bye
console 05477FCA.kill
until 300 GetJournalIndex DA_Malacath == 60
end

case da_malacath_done
run
player->PositionCell 4344 4150 13893 0 "Assurdirapal, Inner Shrine"
wait 120
activate 05565296
until 300 GetJournalIndex DA_Malacath == 70
expect player->GetItemCount helm_bearclaw_unique == 1
end
